# Optional: Claude API key for AI Dungeon Master narration (zone enter, quest complete, etc.).
# Without this, the game uses built-in template narration.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is read by the browser bundle; ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is
# read by the proxy server (preferred — keeps the key off the client).
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: OpenAI API key. Used for TWO things, both server-side (the key
# never reaches the browser):
#   1. Alternative AI narrator — proxy-server.js forwards to OpenAI when Claude
#      is unavailable.
#   2. DALL-E / gpt-image batch generation via scripts/generate-images.mjs.
# A single OPENAI_API_KEY (no VITE_ prefix) covers both uses.
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=
